```

## Optional: GitHub Actions Deploy

The generated CI builds and tests only. To push the image and deploy on every push to `main`, add a workflow such as the one below. It reports **Image push skipped** or **Deploy skipped** and does nothing while a secret is missing.

```yaml
name: Backend Deploy

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
    paths:
      - 'backend/**'

jobs:
  build-and-push:
    name: Build & Push Image
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    outputs:
      image_pushed: {% raw %}${{ steps.push.outcome == 'success' }}{% endraw %}
    env:
      PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED: {% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY != '' && secrets.ACR_USERNAME != '' && secrets.ACR_PASSWORD != '' }}{% endraw %}
    steps:
      - name: Report skipped image push
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED != 'true'
        run: |
          echo "::warning title=Image push skipped::Set the AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY, ACR_USERNAME and ACR_PASSWORD secrets to build and push the backend image."

      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED == 'true'

      - name: Login to Azure Container Registry
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED == 'true'
        uses: azure/docker-login@v2
        with:
          login-server: {% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY }}{% endraw %}
          username: {% raw %}${{ secrets.ACR_USERNAME }}{% endraw %}
          password: {% raw %}${{ secrets.ACR_PASSWORD }}{% endraw %}

      - name: Build and push Docker image
        id: push
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED == 'true'
        working-directory: backend
        run: |
          IMAGE={% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY }}{% endraw %}/{{ project_slug }}-backend
          docker build -t $IMAGE:{% raw %}${{ github.sha }}{% endraw %} -t $IMAGE:latest .
          docker push $IMAGE:{% raw %}${{ github.sha }}{% endraw %}
          docker push $IMAGE:latest

  deploy:
    name: Deploy to Azure
    needs: build-and-push
    if: needs.build-and-push.outputs.image_pushed == 'true'
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    environment: production
    env:
      PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED: {% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CREDENTIALS != '' && secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY != '' && secrets.AZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP != '' && secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_APP_NAME != '' }}{% endraw %}
    steps:
      - name: Report skipped deploy
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED != 'true'
        run: |
          echo "::warning title=Deploy skipped::Set the AZURE_CREDENTIALS, AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY, AZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP and AZURE_CONTAINER_APP_NAME secrets to deploy the backend to Azure Container Apps."

      - name: Azure Login
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED == 'true'
        uses: azure/login@v2
        with:
          creds: {% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CREDENTIALS }}{% endraw %}

      - name: Deploy to Container Apps
        if: env.PRISM_RELEASE_CONFIGURED == 'true'
        run: |
          IMAGE={% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY }}{% endraw %}/{{ project_slug }}-backend:{% raw %}${{ github.sha }}{% endraw %}
          REVISION="sha-$(echo {% raw %}${{ github.sha }}{% endraw %} | head -c 8)"
          az containerapp update \
            --resource-group {% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP }}{% endraw %} \
            --name {% raw %}${{ secrets.AZURE_CONTAINER_APP_NAME }}{% endraw %} \
            --image "$IMAGE" \
            --revision-suffix "$REVISION"
```

### Required GitHub Secrets

| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `AZURE_CREDENTIALS` | Service principal JSON for Azure login |
| `AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY` | ACR login server URL |
| `ACR_USERNAME` | ACR admin username |
| `ACR_PASSWORD` | ACR admin password |
| `AZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP` | Resource group name |
| `AZURE_CONTAINER_APP_NAME` | Container App name |

The project owner creates these secrets; never commit their values.

